{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜科大介紹籌建醫學院最新發展／消費權益新聞報道獎頒獎禮\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261028.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】科大校長葉玉如及醫學院創院院長李競存今日(10月28日)將介紹籌建醫學院最新發展。同日，消委會主辦的消費權益新聞報道獎舉行頒獎禮，表彰傳媒發掘及報道關乎消費者權益的新聞。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:21:01.420546+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T23:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:58:29.764719+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:18:26.764054+00:00","content_hash":"42f79414733b9786b172a66f56f56451d7e6f42fde5e9d1b009672f697d8670d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}